@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Crear producto
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Zapato"}

### Agregar Cuero
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/1/materials
Content-Type: application/json

{"material": "Cuero", "quantity": 2}

### Agregar Suela
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/1/materials
Content-Type: application/json

{"material": "Suela", "quantity": 1}

### Agregar Cordones
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/1/materials
Content-Type: application/json

{"material": "Cordones", "quantity": 1}

### Calcular producción de 100 zapatos
GET {{baseUrl}}/production/calculate?productId=1&quantity=100

### Operarios (API externa)
GET {{baseUrl}}/operators

### Error 400: cantidad inválida
GET {{baseUrl}}/production/calculate?productId=1&quantity=0

### Error 404: producto inexistente
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/999/materials
Content-Type: application/json

{"material": "Cuero", "quantity": 2}
